### P4 — Essay Format Fix (30 min)

**File:** `backend/skills/ship30for30.py`

Add rigid output template in prompt. Llama/Qwen follows templates better than descriptions:
```
OUTPUT TEMPLATE (follow exactly):

## [Specific, Intriguing Headline]

**[One-sentence hook that creates tension or curiosity]**

[Story/example from transcript — 2-3 sentences, cite guest name]

---

## 1. [Section Title]
**[Subpoint in bold]** [1-2 sentences]
**[Subpoint in bold]** [1-2 sentences]

## 2. [Section Title]
...

## 3. [Section Title]
...

---
**The one thing to remember:** [Memorable, shareable insight]
```

Switch model to `qwen3:4b` — better instruction following than `llama3.2`.

